@startuml
title RF7 — Preparar time (LED 3D, relatório do adversário) e jogar partida · Máquina de estados: Modal Preparar time → partida (interação) × Fixture.status
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #FFF7EE
skinparam StateBorderColor #DC5B26
state "Fechado" as CLOSED
CLOSED : central da franquia (RF40)
state "Carregando" as LOADING
LOADING : preparation + opponent-report + settings
LOADING : GLB do S3
state "Preparando (LED 3D)" as PREPARING
PREPARING : confrontos-chave
PREPARING : depth chart e plano
state "Depth chart inválido" as INVALID
INVALID : Jogar desabilitado
state "Pronto" as READY
READY : validated = true
READY : Jogar habilitado
state "Iniciando" as STARTING
STARTING : POST weeks/current/play
STARTING : MatchSession KICKOFF · Fixture LIVE
state "Em partida (RF27)" as IN_MATCH
IN_MATCH : por descida
IN_MATCH : chamadas de jogada (RF62)
state "Semana de folga" as BYE
BYE : Simular semana
state "Espectador" as SPECTATOR
SPECTATOR : desempregado (RF37)
[*] --> CLOSED
CLOSED --> LOADING : Preparar time
LOADING --> PREPARING : 200
LOADING --> SPECTATOR : 403 SPECTATOR_MODE
LOADING --> BYE : sem jogo nesta semana
BYE --> CLOSED : semana simulada
LOADING --> IN_MATCH : partida em andamento (retoma)
PREPARING --> INVALID : 422 DEPTH_CHART_INVALID
INVALID --> PREPARING : corrige
PREPARING --> READY : depth chart + plano salvos
READY --> STARTING : Jogar partida
STARTING --> READY : 409 WEEK_NOT_COMPLETED
STARTING --> IN_MATCH : 201 matchId
IN_MATCH --> CLOSED : Fixture FINISHED · pós-jogo
SPECTATOR --> CLOSED : voltar
@enduml
